        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwujila kwa Aisalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tacilitendela canasa liŵasa lya Yakobo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tacisagula soni mtundu wa Isalaeli kuŵa ŵandu ŵakwe ŵakwepe, nipo tacija kwatamika mcilambo ciŵapele. Ŵandu ŵa yilambo yine tacijawula nawo yalumo nipo tacitama kukoko pamo ni ŵa mwiŵasa lya Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tacapecesya Aisalaeli pakwawula ku cilambo cele AMBUJE ŵapele. Tacitama nawo kukoko nipo tacatumicilaga Aisalaeli mpela acikapolo ŵacakongwe ni ŵacalume. Ŵele uŵakamwile Aisalaeli sambano tacikamulwa ni Aisalaeli, nipo ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli tacalamulila ŵandu ŵele uŵalagasisye jemanjajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya mcilambo ca ŵandu ŵawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE tacimpumusya ku yipwetesi ni yisawusyo yenu, soni ku masengo gele ŵandu giŵamkanganicisyaga kuti mkamuleje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timciŵeceta mwano kumŵecetela mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenye jwa ngalwe agwile! Ngisapakombola soni kwalagasya ŵaliwose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE atemangwile yikoti ya ŵandu wakusakala, ajonasile simbo ja ucimwene ja ŵakulamula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵajiwulagaga mitundu ja ŵandu, mwakutumbila pakwaputa jemanjajo mwangalecesya. Ŵajilamulilaga mitundu ja ŵandu mwa ukali, ni kwalagasya mwangalecesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilambo cosope capasi cipumwile, nipo ŵandu akwimba mwakusengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yitela ya payini yikusengwa, soni mikungusa ja ku Lebanoni jikuti, ‘Kutyocela ndaŵi jiŵamgwisisye m'mwejo pasi, pangali soni jwine jwalijose juŵayice kukutugwisya.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku malembe kuli cile kuti kumpocele, mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya pakwika. Misimu ja ŵandu uŵasicidwe m'malembego, jijimwice kuti jimkomasye m'mweji, misimu ja wosope ŵele ŵaliji, acimlongola pa cilambo capasi. Misimujo jikwimilila pa yitengu yawo ya ucimwene, wosope ŵele ŵaliji ayimwene ŵa mitundu ja ŵandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wosopewo taciŵeceta, nipo tacimsalila kuti, ‘M'mweji soni macili genu gamasile mpela uweji! Sambano mli mpela uwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ucimbicimbi wenu umasile, nyimbo siŵamjimbilaga ni yitolilo syosope simasile, nambo sambano mli mcilambo ca ŵandu ŵawe. Mkusagona pa cindanda ca mbisu soni cakuliwunicila cenu cili nyongolosi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya, m'mwe mng'andu, mgwile kutyocela kwinani, kalakala mwajipundaga mitundu ja ŵandu, nambo lelo amgwisisye pasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.8.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciw 8:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mtima mwenu mwatiji kuti tinjikwela mpaka kwinani; pacanya pa ndondwa sya Mlungu, tinjitamikapo citengu cangu ca ucimwene; Tinjitama pa citengupo pa litumbi lya kumpoto, kwele milungu josope jikusasongana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.11.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 11:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 10:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinjikwela pacanya pa mawunde, ni kuŵa mpela Jwamaciligosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo amtulwisye ni kumsika m'malembe, pasi pasyesyene pa lisimbo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŵandu ŵawe pitacimlola tacimlolecesya ni kuganisyaga ya m'mwejo kuti, ‘Ana aju ngaŵa mundu juŵacitetemelesyaga cilambo capasi, ni kugatenganya ma ucimwene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana jweleju ngaŵa juŵacitendekasisye cilambo capasi kuŵa cipululu ligongo lyakujijonanga misinda jakwe, soni nganiŵakundaga ŵandu ŵakamulwa kuti awujile kumangwawo?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ucimwene gosope ga mitundu ja ŵandu gakugona mwa ucimbicimbi jwalijose malembe gakwegakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo m'mwe ŵangali lilembe, mtembo wenu awujasile kusa kwa lilembe kuti uwole. Mtembo wenu awuwunicile ni asilikali, uŵawulajidwe ku ngondo ni mawupanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasiŵasika m'malembe yalumo ni ayimwene ŵakucimbicikwa, ligongo lyakuti acijonasile cilambo cawo, pakwawulaga ŵandu ŵawo. Yisukulu ya ŵandu ŵakusakala kuti yikakumbucila ni panandi pose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mŵe cile kwawulaga ŵanace ŵacalume ŵa mwenyeju.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu tacajonanga Ababiloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope akuŵeceta kuti, “Tinjiputa ngondo ni msinda wa Babiloni. Tinjilimasya lina lya Babiloni ni wosope ŵitaciŵa ali ciŵela, ngisapagwa jwakulupuka, ŵanace ni yisukulu yakwe. Une AMBUJE mbecete myoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
