        },
        {
          "text": "Msindawo tinjiwusandusya kuŵa lilambo lya matope ni malo gakutamamo acikasisi. Tinjiwupyajila ni lisace lyalikusakokola yosope yayisigele. Nguŵeceta myoyo une AMBUJE.”",
          "type": "text",
