        {
          "text": "Tinjajonanga Asiliya mcilambo mwangu, soni tinjaliŵata ni sajo syangu pa matumbi gangu. Sambano ŵandu ŵangu tinjawula likongwa lyele Asiliya liŵawecice, tinjatyocesya katundu jwakusitopesya pa makoyo gawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
