        {
          "text": "Mlile mwakwesya maloŵe jemanja ŵimli pa yipata, mgumile kwaŵenda cikamucisyo ŵandu ŵa mu msinda. Mtetemeleje ni woga jemanja Afilisiti wosope, liwunde lya lyosi likutyocela kumpoto, nipo sikati ja ŵa ngondo ŵakwisawo pangali jwa woga.",
